+            <pre style="width:100%;margin:0;"><code class="language-json" data-trim data-noescape style="font-size:0.65em;line-height:1.25;">
+{"name": "partition",
+ "description":
+   "Partitionne un graphe Scotch
+    en `parts` parties.",
+ "input_schema": {
+   "type": "object",
+   "properties": {
+     "graph_file": {"type": "string"},
+     "parts":      {"type": "integer"}},
+   "required": ["graph_file", "parts"]}}
+</code></pre>
+            <p style="font-size:0.4em;color:#444;margin-top:0.4em;">La docstring est devenue la <em>description</em> : c'est elle qui décide si l'outil sera appelé.</p>
