+          "text": "The schema's clear now. Real signal is 140 `user` / 261 `assistant` lines; user prompts are the 28 string-content ones (the 112 arrays are tool results), and assistant turns are one-block-per-line grouped by `requestId`, with `text` / `thinking` / `tool_use` blocks. `isMeta` and system-reminder wrappers mark the injected noise. Building all four pieces now: exporter, viewer, modal helper, and wiring an example into the deck.\n\nFirst, the exporter at repo root:"
